  "content_description": "Action Item - Teams",
  "content_text_body": "The goal here is to identify opportunities to learn from your team members. \n\n### Sample stretch opportunities\n\nStretch opportunities are challenging projects, roles or activities outside of team members' current role that will allow them to learn and grow.\n\nEach team member should keep an eye out for opportunities that can help other team members grow. For example, senior team members might mentor junior team members on a specific process or task, and senior team members could stretch their skills by learning how to teach junior team members complex tasks.\n\nAs a group, brainstorm ways to learn from each other.",
